#
# === Monorepo .gitignore ===
#
# This file is structured logically.
# 1. Dependencies & Tool Caches
# 2. General Build Outputs
# 3. Project-Specific (SvelteKit, Astro, etc.)
# 4. Logs, Runtime, and Temp Files
# 5. Environment & Config
# 6. Testing & Coverage
# 7. OS & Editor Specific
# 8. Global Allow-List (Exceptions)
#

# --- 1. Dependencies & Tool Caches ---
## 📦 Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp/
.pnp.js

## 🧰 Caches (npm, yarn, pnpm, etc.)
.npm/
.yarn-integrity
.pnpm-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

## ⚡ Caches (Vite, Parcel, ESLint, TS)
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
.rpt2_cache/
.rts2_cache_cjs/
.rts2_cache_es/
.rts2_cache_umd/
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

# --- 2. General Build Outputs ---
## 🚀 General Build Outputs
build/
dist/
.output/
*.tgz
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# --- 3. Project-Specific ---
## 🦕 Deno
# Deno's lockfile is usually committed for reproducible builds,
# but it can be ignored if your team prefers.
# deno.lock

## ⚡ Backend (Generic)
# Add any backend-specific build outputs here
# e.g., /apps/backend/bin/
# e.g., /apps/backend/target/

## ⚛️ Project: SvelteKit
.svelte-kit/
.vite
# `build/` is already covered above

## 🧑‍🚀 Project: Astro
.astro/
# `dist/` is already covered above

## 📖 Project: Storybook
.out/
.storybook-out/
storybook-static/
*storybook.log

##  TRANSLATION (Paraglide / inlang)
**/project.inlang/cache/
src/lib/paraglide

## 🖼️ Project: ComfyUI Image Microservice
# Models and caches are too large; per-directory .gitignore keeps structure.

# as OS/IDE rules are already handled globally.

# Build configuration
/custom.py
misc/hooks/pre-commit-custom-*

# --- 4. Logs, Runtime, and Temp Files ---
## 📜 Logs
logs/
*.log

## 🏃 Runtime Data
pids/
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
# Root-level runtime data dir (legacy deno setup). Anchored to the repo
# root so source directories named `runtime/` under packages/ are tracked
# normally (e.g. packages/shared/schemas/src/lib/runtime/ — C-389).
/runtime/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## 🐘 Local PostgreSQL (C-387)
# Data dir + sockets + logs for the Nix-provided dev server (lifecycle:
# Removed in C-436 (Postgres decommission).

# Pre-migration logical backups taken by the `database` deploy app (C-394 AC-5).
# pg_dump output stored outside Neon — Neon Free history retention is 6 hours.
.db-backups/

# --- 5. Environment & Config ---
## 🔑 Environment Variables
# Ignore all .env files...
.env
.env.*
# ...except for the example template.
!.env.example

## 🔥 Firebase
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log

## ☁️ Deployment / Hosting
.vercel/
.netlify/
.wrangler/
wrangler.generated.jsonc
wrangler.deploy.json
Dockerfile.prod
docker-compose.override.yml

## 🔒 Security & DB
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
.sentryclirc

## 🏠 Local Dev
.local/
local/

# --- 6. Testing & Coverage ---
## 🧪 Testing & Coverage
coverage/
*.lcov
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
.auth/
.vscode-test/
## Ad-hoc debug scripts (not part of the suite)
*.tmp.js
*.tmp.cjs
## Visual snapshots are only baselined for linux (CI's platform) — local
## runs on other platforms produce their own *-win32.png/*-darwin.png that
## must never be committed as if they were the golden baseline.
**/*-snapshots/*-win32.png
**/*-snapshots/*-darwin.png

